<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise nine-month sales fall.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise nine-month sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	     (All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>	     Turnover		   66,983.5  vs  73,109.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Lyonnaise gave the sales figures in the official bulletin BALO. It said sales rose 2.2 percent at constant structure and exchange rates and were up 6.3 percent compared to restated proforma 1995 figures.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
</text>
